{
  "info": {
    "name": "Academy — Quiz API",
    "_postman_id": "academy-quiz-api-v1",
    "description": "REST API for Moodle quizzes — replaces web view with native mobile UI.\n\nSupported question types: multichoice (single + multi-answer), truefalse.\nUnsupported types appear with supported=false and no options.\n\nImages: every question and option returns a plain 'text' field (all HTML tags stripped) plus an 'images' array of image URLs (webservice/pluginfile.php). No HTML is returned. Append '?token=STUDENT_TOKEN' to each image URL to load it.\n\nFlow A (one-shot): Start Attempt → Submit Answers → Get Attempt (review).\nFlow B (incremental): Start Attempt → Save One Answer (per question, no close) → Finish Attempt (submit all).\n\n1. Run Login as Admin or Login as Student to get tokens.\n2. Use Get Quizzes to find a quiz and its cmid.\n3. Admin: Get Quiz includes correct answers on every option.\n\nVariables: base_url, admin_token, student_token, cmid, quizid, attemptid.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url",      "value": "http://localhost:8081", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "admin_token",   "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "student_token", "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "cmid",          "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "quizid",        "value": "",                      "type": "string" },
    { "key": "attemptid",     "value": "",                      "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [

    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login as Admin",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "var j = pm.response.json();",
            "if (j && j.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('admin_token', j.token); console.log('admin_token saved'); }"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "urlencoded", "urlencoded": [
              { "key": "username", "value": "admin",             "type": "text" },
              { "key": "password", "value": "123456",            "type": "text" },
              { "key": "service",  "value": "moodle_mobile_app", "type": "text" }
            ]},
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/login/token.php", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["login","token.php"] },
            "description": "Logs in as admin. Saves token into {{admin_token}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Login as Student",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "var j = pm.response.json();",
            "if (j && j.token) { pm.collectionVariables.set('student_token', j.token); console.log('student_token saved'); }"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "urlencoded", "urlencoded": [
              { "key": "username", "value": "student@example.com", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "password", "value": "123456",              "type": "text" },
              { "key": "service",  "value": "moodle_mobile_app",   "type": "text" }
            ]},
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/login/token.php", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["login","token.php"] },
            "description": "Logs in as student. Saves token into {{student_token}}."
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "Browse Quizzes",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Quizzes",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php?function=get_quizzes&token={{student_token}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "function", "value": "get_quizzes" },
                { "key": "token",    "value": "{{student_token}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns all quizzes on the platform.\n\nResponse fields per quiz:\n- quizid, cmid, courseid, name, intro, timelimit (seconds, 0=none), attempts_allowed (0=unlimited)"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Quizzes by Course",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php?function=get_quizzes&token={{student_token}}&courseid=2",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "function", "value": "get_quizzes" },
                { "key": "token",    "value": "{{student_token}}" },
                { "key": "courseid", "value": "2" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Filter quizzes by course id."
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "Get Quiz Questions",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Quiz — Student (no correct answers)",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "var j = pm.response.json();",
            "if (j && j.status === 'success' && j.data) {",
            "  pm.collectionVariables.set('quizid', j.data.quizid);",
            "  console.log('quizid saved: ' + j.data.quizid);",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php?function=get_quiz&token={{student_token}}&cmid={{cmid}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "function", "value": "get_quiz" },
                { "key": "token",    "value": "{{student_token}}" },
                { "key": "cmid",     "value": "{{cmid}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Returns quiz with all questions and answer options.\nStudent token: options do NOT include the 'correct' field.\nAlso saves quizid into {{quizid}}."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Quiz — Admin (with correct answers)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php?function=get_quiz&token={{admin_token}}&cmid={{cmid}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "function", "value": "get_quiz" },
                { "key": "token",    "value": "{{admin_token}}" },
                { "key": "cmid",     "value": "{{cmid}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Same as above but with admin token.\nEach option includes: \"correct\": true / false."
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "Take a Quiz (Student Flow)",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "1 — Start Attempt",
          "event": [{ "listen": "test", "script": { "type": "text/javascript", "exec": [
            "var j = pm.response.json();",
            "if (j && j.status === 'success' && j.data) {",
            "  pm.collectionVariables.set('attemptid', j.data.attemptid);",
            "  console.log('attemptid saved: ' + j.data.attemptid);",
            "}"
          ]}}],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "urlencoded", "urlencoded": [
              { "key": "function", "value": "start_quiz_attempt",  "type": "text" },
              { "key": "token",    "value": "{{student_token}}",   "type": "text" },
              { "key": "quizid",   "value": "{{quizid}}",          "type": "text" }
            ]},
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"] },
            "description": "Starts a new quiz attempt for the logged-in student.\nSaves the returned attemptid into {{attemptid}}.\n\nResponse: attemptid, quizid, attempt_number, timestart, timelimit, state"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2 — Submit Answers (Single MCQ + True/False)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "urlencoded", "urlencoded": [
              { "key": "function",   "value": "submit_quiz_attempt",                                 "type": "text" },
              { "key": "token",      "value": "{{student_token}}",                                   "type": "text" },
              { "key": "attemptid",  "value": "{{attemptid}}",                                       "type": "text" },
              { "key": "answers",    "value": "[{\"questionid\":101,\"answer\":3},{\"questionid\":102,\"answer\":11}]", "type": "text" }
            ]},
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"] },
            "description": "Submit answers and finish the attempt.\n\nanswers format:\n- Single MCQ or True/False: { \"questionid\": 101, \"answer\": 3 }  (answer = the id of the chosen option)\n- Multi-answer MCQ:          { \"questionid\": 103, \"answer\": [3,5] }\n\nResponse: score, max_score, percent, results[] with per-question mark and correct flag."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2 — Submit Answers (Multi-answer MCQ)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "urlencoded", "urlencoded": [
              { "key": "function",   "value": "submit_quiz_attempt",                                        "type": "text" },
              { "key": "token",      "value": "{{student_token}}",                                          "type": "text" },
              { "key": "attemptid",  "value": "{{attemptid}}",                                              "type": "text" },
              { "key": "answers",    "value": "[{\"questionid\":103,\"answer\":[3,5]},{\"questionid\":104,\"answer\":11}]", "type": "text" }
            ]},
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"] },
            "description": "Example with a multi-answer MCQ question (answer is an array of option ids)."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2a — Save One Answer (no close)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "urlencoded", "urlencoded": [
              { "key": "function",   "value": "save_quiz_answer",   "type": "text" },
              { "key": "token",      "value": "{{student_token}}",  "type": "text" },
              { "key": "attemptid",  "value": "{{attemptid}}",      "type": "text" },
              { "key": "questionid", "value": "101",                "type": "text" },
              { "key": "answer",     "value": "3",                  "type": "text" }
            ]},
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"] },
            "description": "Save the answer to ONE question WITHOUT finishing the attempt.\nThe attempt stays 'inprogress'. Call once per question as the student answers.\n\nanswer format:\n- Single MCQ / True-False: answer=3  (the chosen option id)\n- Multi-answer MCQ:        answer=[3,5]\n\nCalling it again for the same questionid overwrites the previous answer."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "2b — Finish Attempt (submit all saved)",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST", "header": [],
            "body": { "mode": "urlencoded", "urlencoded": [
              { "key": "function",  "value": "finish_quiz_attempt", "type": "text" },
              { "key": "token",     "value": "{{student_token}}",   "type": "text" },
              { "key": "attemptid", "value": "{{attemptid}}",       "type": "text" }
            ]},
            "url": { "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php", "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"] },
            "description": "Submit ALL questions: grades every answer saved via 'save_quiz_answer' and closes the attempt.\nNo answers body needed.\n\nResponse: same shape as submit_quiz_attempt (score, max_score, percent, results[])."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "3 — Review My Attempt",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php?function=get_quiz_attempt&token={{student_token}}&attemptid={{attemptid}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "function",   "value": "get_quiz_attempt" },
                { "key": "token",      "value": "{{student_token}}" },
                { "key": "attemptid",  "value": "{{attemptid}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Review a finished attempt.\nStudent token: question data returned without correct answers.\nAdmin token: each question includes correct_answers[]."
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Review Attempt — Admin (with correct answers)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php?function=get_quiz_attempt&token={{admin_token}}&attemptid={{attemptid}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "function",  "value": "get_quiz_attempt" },
                { "key": "token",     "value": "{{admin_token}}" },
                { "key": "attemptid", "value": "{{attemptid}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Admin review — includes correct_answers[] per question."
          }
        }
      ]
    },

    {
      "name": "My Attempt History",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get My Quiz Attempts",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET", "header": [],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/local/academy/api.php?function=get_my_quiz_attempts&token={{student_token}}&quizid={{quizid}}",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"], "path": ["local","academy","api.php"],
              "query": [
                { "key": "function", "value": "get_my_quiz_attempts" },
                { "key": "token",    "value": "{{student_token}}" },
                { "key": "quizid",   "value": "{{quizid}}" }
              ]
            },
            "description": "Lists all attempts the current student has made on this quiz.\n\nResponse per attempt: attemptid, attempt_number, state, score, max_score, percent, timestart, timefinish."
          }
        }
      ]
    }

  ]
}
